WEBVTT

00:09.134 --> 00:12.387
Do you know any of them?

00:13.555 --> 00:16.725
It seems there's no survivor in this area.

00:18.268 --> 00:19.519
According to the report,

00:19.644 --> 00:22.147
a few new Mizunoto-ranked members

00:22.313 --> 00:24.899
arrived and went up the mountain shortly.

00:25.984 --> 00:28.319
Maybe they are all dead.

00:29.654 --> 00:30.780
Let's go.

00:32.907 --> 00:35.076
The moon is so beautiful.

00:36.995 --> 00:39.414
We're finally on a mission together.

00:39.497 --> 00:41.374
Let's get along well.

00:42.542 --> 00:44.627
I came here to slay demons.

00:45.170 --> 00:46.880
You're so cold.

00:48.256 --> 00:51.009
Let's go our separate ways here.

00:51.676 --> 00:53.344
I'll search from the west.

00:54.179 --> 00:55.221
Understood.

01:04.773 --> 01:09.861
Stay away from my family!

01:13.656 --> 01:16.034
Breath of Water. Second Form.

01:16.201 --> 01:17.911
Water Wheel!

03:08.521 --> 03:11.190
This is bad.
My sword can't pierce his flesh!

03:19.657 --> 03:23.161
His skin is incredibly tough!

03:29.500 --> 03:31.586
Even my Breath of Water
can't pierce his flesh.

03:31.753 --> 03:34.005
What should I do?

03:36.049 --> 03:38.635
Stay away

03:38.801 --> 03:41.763
from my family!

03:46.684 --> 03:48.144
Where are you looking at?

03:48.394 --> 03:49.354
I'm here!

03:49.729 --> 03:52.023
Die!

03:58.446 --> 03:59.989
It hurts so much.

04:00.240 --> 04:03.409
He merely swung his arm.
Yet it's so powerful.

04:03.493 --> 04:04.410
This is bad.

04:04.494 --> 04:06.412
I can't use all my strength.

04:06.871 --> 04:09.624
Plus, I'm losing too much blood
and I'm feeling dizzy.

04:13.711 --> 04:14.671
Damn it.

04:17.382 --> 04:18.466
Breath of Water.

04:19.050 --> 04:20.927
Second Form Modified.

04:21.803 --> 04:23.429
Lateral Water Wheel.

04:44.575 --> 04:45.743
What the heck?

04:46.327 --> 04:47.578
What's going on?

04:47.662 --> 04:49.580
Inosuke! Are you okay?

04:52.625 --> 04:54.544
Did that guy do it?

04:54.627 --> 04:56.963
Damn, he's good.

05:04.429 --> 05:07.724
All right. At this rate,
I can chop off even the toughest neck.

05:08.558 --> 05:09.851
Breath of Water.

05:10.310 --> 05:12.478
The last form is the strongest.

05:17.525 --> 05:19.277
His breath has changed.

05:20.069 --> 05:23.823
It seems that he is going to do
something amazing.

05:26.200 --> 05:27.618
I'll finish him off with one move!

05:30.621 --> 05:31.998
Total Concentration Breathing.

05:32.206 --> 05:33.499
Breath of Water.

05:34.125 --> 05:35.543
Tenth Form!

05:37.879 --> 05:38.713
Damn it!

05:44.218 --> 05:45.136
Watch out!

05:47.889 --> 05:49.557
Kentaro!

05:50.391 --> 05:51.642
Inosuke!

05:51.809 --> 05:54.687
Before I come back, don't die!

05:54.896 --> 05:56.939
That guy is from Twelve Demon Moons!

05:57.231 --> 05:58.357
You can't die!

05:58.691 --> 05:59.817
Don't die!

05:59.984 --> 06:02.487
You mustn't die!

06:14.791 --> 06:15.875
Oh, no!

06:29.430 --> 06:34.018
I can't breathe properly.

06:34.977 --> 06:39.690
I can't feel...

06:40.483 --> 06:42.735
my limbs at all.

06:56.541 --> 06:58.042
Nezuko.

06:59.210 --> 07:00.336
I'm sorry.

07:07.510 --> 07:09.053
Don't give up!

07:10.471 --> 07:12.098
Don't give up!

07:13.516 --> 07:15.226
Don't give up!

07:16.519 --> 07:20.398
I can't give up.

07:44.130 --> 07:46.424
Who are you?

07:50.553 --> 07:51.971
Hello.

07:52.555 --> 07:54.098
Are you okay?

08:00.480 --> 08:03.232
Breath of Water. Second Form.

08:04.859 --> 08:06.277
Water Wheel.

08:13.951 --> 08:15.912
I somehow landed safely.

08:19.373 --> 08:21.292
I beg you. Please stop!

08:51.197 --> 08:52.740
What are you looking at?

08:53.533 --> 08:55.618
There's nothing to see here.

08:58.204 --> 08:59.622
What are you doing?

09:00.373 --> 09:03.084
Aren't you guys comrades?

09:03.834 --> 09:05.044
Comrades?

09:05.711 --> 09:08.714
Don't group us
with that kind of fragile relationship.

09:09.298 --> 09:11.092
We are a family.

09:11.676 --> 09:14.136
There's a strong bond between us.

09:15.137 --> 09:16.764
Not to mention,

09:17.431 --> 09:19.725
this is my problem with my older sister.

09:20.643 --> 09:22.728
If you butt in,

09:23.604 --> 09:24.855
I'll cut you into pieces.

09:27.400 --> 09:28.442
That's not right.

09:28.776 --> 09:30.361
Be it your family or comrade,

09:30.695 --> 09:32.697
if there is a strong bond
between each other,

09:32.905 --> 09:34.740
you are equally precious to each other.

09:35.533 --> 09:38.077
Just because there isn't a blood relation,
you said it's fragile.

09:38.661 --> 09:40.037
That's definitely not true!

09:40.746 --> 09:44.166
If you two are connected by a strong bond,

09:44.250 --> 09:45.751
I'll be able to smell trust.

09:46.252 --> 09:47.920
But I could only smell

09:48.337 --> 09:51.090
fear, hatred, and terror from you two.

09:51.882 --> 09:54.093
That's not a bond.

09:54.427 --> 09:55.636
It's fake.

09:55.928 --> 09:57.221
It's a forged bond!

10:03.060 --> 10:04.395
You...

10:10.651 --> 10:13.362
It seems that there's a demon
of just the right size here.

10:14.030 --> 10:17.450
Even I can handle a kid demon like this.

10:18.701 --> 10:21.370
-Hang on--
-You better step aside.

10:21.746 --> 10:24.332
I want to take
the safe route up the ladder.

10:24.999 --> 10:29.211
As long as you can move up, the rewards
given by our superior will increase too.

10:29.670 --> 10:32.882
Almost all the members
from my squad are dead.

10:32.965 --> 10:36.510
Anyway, I need to defeat
a decent-sized demon

10:36.594 --> 10:38.012
before I leave the mountain.

10:38.638 --> 10:39.555
Come on!

10:39.639 --> 10:41.223
No, stop it!

10:47.813 --> 10:49.899
He cut him into pieces instantly.

10:50.358 --> 10:51.567
What just happened?

10:52.902 --> 10:55.321
Hey, what did you say?

11:00.201 --> 11:01.327
You...

11:02.370 --> 11:04.997
What did you say just now?

11:08.084 --> 11:09.835
What an intense oppressing sensation.

11:10.628 --> 11:13.923
The air feels so heavy and cold.

11:16.675 --> 11:18.803
I'm sorry, Inosuke.

11:19.553 --> 11:22.306
Do your best and hang on.

11:23.015 --> 11:25.601
After I defeat this demon,
I'll come and find you.

11:27.144 --> 11:29.772
I'll definitely save you.

11:30.940 --> 11:33.609
The words you said just now.

11:34.777 --> 11:36.654
Try repeating it.

11:38.197 --> 11:39.156
Hey.

11:39.698 --> 11:41.158
Speak up.

11:41.742 --> 11:44.286
Sure. I'll repeat it
as many times as you want.

11:44.787 --> 11:46.956
Your bond is fake!

12:14.024 --> 12:15.234
This is bad.

12:22.324 --> 12:23.325
Damn it.

12:23.659 --> 12:25.911
I'm actually hiding at this place.

12:25.995 --> 12:27.496
What a wimp.

12:28.247 --> 12:30.458
But I must think it thoroughly.

12:31.000 --> 12:34.336
What's the best way to pierce
a guy who has impenetrable skin?

12:35.254 --> 12:37.923
What should I do?

12:38.215 --> 12:40.718
What should I do to penetrate his flesh?

12:41.177 --> 12:44.221
Think!

12:49.477 --> 12:51.687
Shit, this is bad!

12:52.605 --> 12:53.772
Before that brat...

12:53.856 --> 12:57.359
Before that brat returns,
I must figure out a way.

13:00.237 --> 13:02.656
What kind of stupid mindset is this?

13:04.825 --> 13:07.411
Are you kidding me?

13:13.959 --> 13:15.878
Damn you.

13:16.879 --> 13:21.050
I was contaminated by Tontaro's bacteria.

13:21.133 --> 13:22.968
I'm actually thinking like him.

13:23.052 --> 13:24.929
I'm almost done for.

13:25.346 --> 13:30.059
Thinking doesn't reflect my true nature!

13:34.438 --> 13:37.149
How about it? I severed your arm!

13:39.026 --> 13:41.153
It's that simple.

13:41.278 --> 13:43.113
If I can't cut it off in one slash,

13:43.280 --> 13:46.575
I'll just hammer the sword
until it goes through.

13:46.867 --> 13:50.871
Because I have two swords!

13:53.457 --> 13:55.376
I'm the strongest!

14:00.798 --> 14:02.800
Why are you running away?

14:03.050 --> 14:05.844
Hold it, you jerk!

14:19.400 --> 14:20.818
Let me make things straight.

14:21.068 --> 14:23.988
I won't kill you immediately.

14:24.572 --> 14:27.992
I'll cut you to pieces and chop you up.

14:32.162 --> 14:33.205
However,

14:33.706 --> 14:36.041
if you take back the words you just said,

14:36.500 --> 14:38.711
maybe I'll show you mercy
and kill you instantly.

14:38.961 --> 14:40.254
I won't take it back.

14:40.671 --> 14:42.756
Everything I said was right!

14:43.507 --> 14:46.260
You're the problem!

14:53.517 --> 14:55.853
You're the one who's wrong!

15:12.912 --> 15:13.871
Damn it.

15:13.954 --> 15:17.499
Where did he go? Damn it.

15:20.961 --> 15:24.298
These injuries don't hurt at all.

15:24.673 --> 15:27.509
I don't feel pain at all.

15:27.927 --> 15:29.094
Now that it has come to this,

15:29.720 --> 15:31.680
I must find him.

15:43.859 --> 15:45.277
There you are!

15:45.778 --> 15:49.365
Why did this bastard climb so high up?

15:50.574 --> 15:51.784
Bastard!

15:51.992 --> 15:55.371
He's playing tricks to make me think.

15:55.871 --> 15:57.289
I won't fall for it.

16:01.502 --> 16:02.503
What?

16:03.253 --> 16:04.713
I see.

16:05.047 --> 16:08.467
You're trembling in fear because of me.

16:10.511 --> 16:12.304
It's too late now!

16:18.060 --> 16:19.979
What? This...

16:25.275 --> 16:27.695
He shed his skin!

16:38.789 --> 16:39.915
No way.

16:40.290 --> 16:43.585
How could you become so huge?

16:44.086 --> 16:45.629
This doesn't look good.

16:46.296 --> 16:50.259
I have never felt this kind of
immense pressure from an enemy before.

16:50.968 --> 16:53.137
The pressure alone is crushing me.

16:58.517 --> 16:59.601
I'm doomed.

17:00.185 --> 17:01.228
I can't win.

17:09.194 --> 17:10.446
I'm going to die.

17:12.364 --> 17:13.657
He's going to kill me.

17:15.034 --> 17:16.035
Don't die!

17:17.494 --> 17:20.122
Before I come back, don't die!

17:21.415 --> 17:26.628
You should be proud of yourselves
and strive to survive at all times.

17:27.337 --> 17:29.298
Good luck in your fight.

17:32.134 --> 17:33.260
I won't give in!

17:34.636 --> 17:36.638
I'll never give in!

17:37.556 --> 17:41.268
I'm Inosuke Hashibira
from Demon Slayer Corps.

17:41.393 --> 17:44.104
Come at me, you piece of shit!

17:45.981 --> 17:46.940
He's fast.

17:47.149 --> 17:48.358
I couldn't see him.

17:55.074 --> 17:56.909
Breath of the Beast.

17:57.701 --> 17:59.078
Third Fang.

17:59.453 --> 18:00.954
Rip and Devour.

18:02.998 --> 18:03.957
What?

18:09.463 --> 18:10.631
Shoot.

18:11.006 --> 18:13.842
I couldn't adjust in time and got hit
because of my Breath Style.

18:15.177 --> 18:19.515
Stay away from my family.

18:20.432 --> 18:22.392
I won't die.

18:22.893 --> 18:25.771
Breath of the Beast. First Fang.

18:26.814 --> 18:29.650
Take this. Pierce and Extract!

18:31.944 --> 18:33.320
It went in.

18:33.529 --> 18:35.197
Although I stabbed him,

18:35.572 --> 18:39.326
it seems this guy feels nothing.

18:59.763 --> 19:01.056
I'm sorry.

19:03.684 --> 19:06.228
I'm sorry, Inosuke.

19:18.824 --> 19:20.826
You must live on.

19:21.785 --> 19:22.953
Inosuke.

19:29.835 --> 19:32.963
Who was that?

19:44.141 --> 19:45.350
What's happening?

19:47.311 --> 19:49.897
Did that guy do it?

19:51.148 --> 19:54.860
Who the heck is he?

20:06.330 --> 20:07.331
How quick.

20:09.124 --> 20:11.793
Breath of Water. Fourth Form.

20:12.211 --> 20:13.170
Striking Tide.

20:21.803 --> 20:24.181
How amazing.

20:29.311 --> 20:32.272
It's my first time seeing

20:32.856 --> 20:35.442
such an amazing guy.

20:43.825 --> 20:44.826
I can tell.

20:45.244 --> 20:46.912
The pungent stench has faded.

20:47.913 --> 20:49.665
I can distinguish
the smell of his threads.

20:50.499 --> 20:52.125
At this rate, I can fight.

20:54.628 --> 20:57.047
This guy is smarter than I thought.

20:57.756 --> 20:59.508
He doesn't give in to fear at all.

21:00.592 --> 21:03.387
But this has nothing to do
with intelligence.

21:10.978 --> 21:12.396
Breath of Water.

21:12.813 --> 21:13.981
First Form.

21:14.731 --> 21:16.692
Water Surface Slash.

22:53.163 --> 22:54.372
How amazing and fearsome!

22:54.456 --> 22:56.208
You defeated that demon in a split second!

22:56.291 --> 22:57.459
Who the heck are you?

22:58.251 --> 23:01.171
You used the same moves as Monjiro.
Are you two friends?

23:02.047 --> 23:03.340
Did he not know I'm here?

23:03.423 --> 23:04.758
Look at me!

23:04.966 --> 23:06.968
Come on!

23:07.052 --> 23:08.220
Can you do this?

23:09.137 --> 23:10.055
Hey!

23:12.724 --> 23:15.018
Let me tell you amazing secrets.

23:15.102 --> 23:17.479
I heard that guy, Tanjiro,
likes plum rice ball with kelp.

23:17.562 --> 23:20.315
Zenitsu likes salmon rice ball.

23:21.775 --> 23:24.361
Next, episode 19, "Hinokami."

23:24.861 --> 23:26.363
So you can talk!

23:26.863 --> 23:28.073
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.156 --> 23:29.533
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
